      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive and patient canine trainers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners consistently praise individual trainers, including Kendall and Josh, for their dedication, patience, and encouraging instruction. Clients note that instructors take time to explain canine psychology clearly, demonstrate handling techniques calmly, and adapt classroom exercises to the temperament of each dog."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 27,
      "title": {
        "en": "Noticeable improvements in canine manners"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners report dramatic progress in off-leash recall, doorway patience, and leash walking, especially for high-energy or reactive dogs. However, several reviewers noted that boarding programmes failed to resolve deep-seated behavioural issues and felt that group classes did not adequately replicate real-world scenarios."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Confidence building for reactive dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight successful desensitisation training for anxious rescues, strong-willed herding breeds, and dogs reactive toward unfamiliar animals. While a small minority expressed concern regarding canine stress during e-collar conditioning, the vast majority observe their pets arriving enthusiastically for weekly classes."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What training formats are offered at Sit Means Sit?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients report choosing between multi-week board-and-train immersion programmes, private one-on-one sessions, and ongoing group classes."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can the facility help dogs with severe leash reactivity?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, many owners note significant reductions in reactivity towards other dogs and strangers following structured training."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are group practice classes included with training packages?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients highlight attending follow-up group sessions and pack walks to reinforce obedience skills in distracting environments."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
